---
import { Clock, Facebook, Instagram, MapPin, Phone, Send } from 'lucide-react';
const socials = [
  { href: 'https://instagram.com', label: 'Instagram', Icon: Instagram },
  { href: 'https://t.me', label: 'Telegram', Icon: Send },
  { href: 'https://facebook.com', label: 'Facebook', Icon: Facebook },
];
---
<footer id="contacts" class="bg-espresso text-sand">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-14 px-6 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_1.2fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="font-serif text-3xl tracking-[0.28em] text-cream">MANICARE</p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xs leading-relaxed text-beige">Салон краси для тих, хто цінує деталі, тишу та результат, який тримається.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex gap-3">
        {socials.map(({ href, label, Icon }) => (
          <a href={href} aria-label={label} class="rounded-full border border-cinnamon p-3 transition-colors hover:bg-cream hover:text-espresso"><Icon size={18} /></a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="space-y-5 text-sm">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><MapPin size={18} className="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-beige" />м. Київ, вул. Василя Липківського, 8 </li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><Phone size={18} className="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-beige" /><a href="tel:+380739009073" class="hover:text-cream">+38 (073) 900 90 73</a></li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><Clock size={18} className="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-beige" />Вт–Нд: 10:00–21:00<br />Пн: вихідний</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="group relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-cinnamon/60 shadow-[0_20px_50px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]">
  <iframe
    title="Manicare на карті"
    src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=%D0%9A%D0%B8%D1%97%D0%B2%2C%20%D0%B2%D1%83%D0%BB.%20%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8F%20%D0%9B%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BA%D1%96%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%2C%208&t=&z=16&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed"
    class="h-full w-full border-0 grayscale-[0.55] sepia-[0.25] contrast-[0.95] transition duration-500 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:sepia-0"
    loading="lazy"
    referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
    allowfullscreen
  ></iframe>

  <a
    href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%D0%9A%D0%B8%D1%97%D0%B2%2C%20%D0%B2%D1%83%D0%BB.%20%D0%92%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8F%20%D0%9B%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BA%D1%96%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE%2C%208"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-cream px-4 py-2 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-espresso shadow-lg transition-colors hover:bg-sand"
  >
    <MapPin size={14} />
    Прокласти маршрут
  </a>
</div>
  </div>
  <p class="border-t border-cinnamon/40 py-6 text-center text-xs text-beige">© {new Date().getFullYear()} Manicare. Усі права захищено.</p>
</footer>
